  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Opening branches right beside police stations soon brings Detective Mori of the Hokkaido Police through the door. While Mori inspects the stock for rule violations, Muranishi answers every complaint with unshakable politeness. Listen to the Japanese confrontation first without worrying about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうされました？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "道警の森だ。責任者はいるか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会長、警察の方が来ました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうしましたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "警察の近くにばかり出しやがって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一番近いところに出店したまでです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "この部分をよく見ろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ちゃんと規定をクリアしてますね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "違う！よく見ろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "今日のところは勘弁してやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "お前らの顔は覚えたからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうぞお持ち帰りください。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうされました？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How may I help you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "道警の森だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Mori from the Hokkaido Police.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "責任者はいるか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is the person in charge here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "会長、警察の方が来ました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairman, someone from the police has arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "警察の近くにばかり出しやがって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Opening shops right near the police stations, of all places.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一番近いところに出店したまでです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We simply opened at the closest spot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "この部分をよく見ろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look closely at this part.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "違う！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wrong!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "今日のところは勘弁してやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will let it slide for today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mori",
      "t": "お前らの顔は覚えたからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have memorized your faces, understand?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうぞお持ち帰りください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please feel free to take these home with you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
